  "body": "There's been a number of discussions around conventions for built-in modules, in particular:\r\n\r\n* Enumerability of methods/accessors (see also #719)\r\n* Same-realm brand checks (see also #718)\r\n* Freezing\r\n\r\nLet's figure out what we want, and involve TC39 in the discussion as well, potentially at the 23-25 July 2019 F2F meeting.\r\n\r\nCC @domenic @annevk @bzbarsky",
